  "method": "To calculate the operational gearing, first calculate the contribution margin by subtracting variable costs from sales, then calculate the profit before interest and tax by subtracting fixed costs from the contribution margin. The formula for operational gearing is: (Contribution Margin / Profit Before Interest and Tax).",
